WEBVTT

00:38:28.053 --> 00:38:32.196
will view the opportunity
to collaborate equally strong.

00:38:32.220 --> 00:38:36.506
I think the two countries wanting to be
technically stronger

00:38:36.530 --> 00:38:38.092
in understandable.

00:38:38.116 --> 00:38:41.069
But that doesn't preclude them
from discussing

00:38:41.093 --> 00:38:45.554
how to deal with issues
related to job displacement,

00:38:45.578 --> 00:38:47.625
security and so on.

00:38:47.649 --> 00:38:50.117
Also, I think another thing we can try

00:38:50.141 --> 00:38:52.958
is there are a few application areas

00:38:52.982 --> 00:38:59.661
that countries naturally view
as a common need for humanity.

00:38:59.685 --> 00:39:03.670
Health care would be a really good one
for countries to collaborate,